:::heading{level=3 nodeId="fe7bb534-a6ad-4a92-9ed6-58c7b020c73c"}
3.5 签到规则
:::

:::bullet_list{indent=0 nodeId="21667ba1-5e36-478f-9e8a-5e42cd8c06aa"}
:::list_item{level=0 hidden=false nodeId="949224fe-078e-4013-9821-44b1934356aa"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="dc971f9c-3f92-4fd7-aa81-1d959ffd3d26"}
签到条件：MVP一期无前提条件，直接签到；后期可配置下单/分享等前提
:::
:::
:::list_item{level=0 hidden=false nodeId="fac3d643-9199-4b85-aa0f-a86b533df577"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="6d6f7db2-0ebb-4b7e-9406-6281be1d29d4"}
累计梯度：3次→基础奖品 / 5次→进阶 / 7次→高阶 / 9次→大奖
:::
:::
:::list_item{level=0 hidden=false nodeId="c2917d5d-6e75-4ebe-9449-4e5b34d9ce81"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="7f5950d1-54f5-44b8-9862-ab3eb28ec848"}
奖品类型：虚拟券（直接领取）+ 实物（留资邮寄，运营后台发货）
:::
:::
:::list_item{level=0 hidden=false nodeId="caeff8c3-547d-4d22-99f5-670384504e16"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="d577563e-2ea5-47dc-b6f6-1c66045a60fc"}
限制：每场每人最多签到1次，不可补签
:::
:::
:::

:::horizontal_rule{nodeId="4cb4cbc6-3cb3-41e1-9bb5-12481c8e90d7"}:::

:::heading{level=2 nodeId="575deebc-7ab3-47b8-b98c-9685a3541069"}
四、系统架构（四层）
:::

:::heading{level=3 nodeId="70e6bcf3-65d6-46e4-af11-08833e99a88f"}
4.1 架构说明
:::

:::bullet_list{indent=0 nodeId="b8e6a16a-e1eb-49f7-9a53-b754eef16b84"}
:::list_item{level=0 hidden=false nodeId="727fa951-a9ab-4535-8cdf-85f05caeeb52"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="0acd3761-0a75-4791-baf4-1c11311d3a10"}
基座层：复用任务中心2.0的任务引擎和高达搭建平台
:::
:::
:::list_item{level=0 hidden=false nodeId="7c481795-4875-472b-b1f5-8b3281469831"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="fbc67526-868b-49c6-bf47-45911b9fe9cc"}
原子层（MVP核心）：业务逻辑拆解为可组合的行为/约束/奖励原子
:::
:::
:::list_item{level=0 hidden=false nodeId="99bee828-bd0c-424f-a44d-a7400bdef5e0"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="90688194-3ddd-4420-b8a6-6e3cc5fe81cf"}
AI层：Phase 1引入Kafka事件驱动，Phase 2引入LLM
:::
:::
:::list_item{level=0 hidden=false nodeId="195bf3e4-6f9e-487f-ae9b-837707ea7d03"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="b5bf4b63-e955-4be4-b4e8-3223f96813a7"}
数据产品层：后续版本建设数据看板
:::
:::
:::

:::heading{level=3 nodeId="ec6ce57c-3d4c-49d2-88e7-e603262c4b68"}
4.2 原子能力清单
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="5cf24f03-99b7-43fa-b777-d8bd8a2014c7"}
**行为原子**
:::

:::table{borderColor="#dddddd" borderStyle="solid" borderWidth=1 responsive=false nodeId="1f83bc99-bdcc-46e2-bd4e-6bd3a3840111"}
:::table_row{nodeId="9ec9efb4-359d-4a54-bf99-544dab9747ce"}
:::table_header{colwidth="180" bgColor="#FFF" nodeId="d2f34c90-191b-45b0-8f68-88c8c0e75a66"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="f82a155a-ecc7-4c46-9e28-7c45a3180746"}
**原子**
:::
:::
:::table_header{colwidth="570" bgColor="#FFF" nodeId="87c00686-a5d7-40c0-8e23-7bd55a762d87"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="846a851b-f31a-4524-aca1-f56c7c5c53f5"}
**说明**
