:::heading{level=3 nodeId="a71f8f75-84f3-4306-820e-6faf3eb15b80"}
6.2 AI层与高达组件层对接
:::

:::blockquote{nodeId="5747e053-0e9d-493a-99b5-3e0190e1a16f"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="d5863ffe-963a-4043-ba14-267b26cf52c5"}
📌 流程图占位：[ai-gaoda-integration.drawio] — AI层与高达对接流程图，请手动插入 draw.io 文件
:::
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="84ba43a3-5ddf-4abd-abff-8b81f1138f56"}
对接总览：运营M端创建玩法 → 生成玩法ID → AI识别实物奖品自动创建留资表单 → 配置一次性下发高达 → C端初始化查询 → 签到/领奖交互 → 留资弹窗 → 数据回流
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="b6d42d59-7a23-4f1b-9dfd-52cd3e70475a"}
**关键接口清单**
:::

:::table{borderColor="#dddddd" borderStyle="solid" borderWidth=1 responsive=false nodeId="4daf2555-e86d-4506-bfb7-f0ae67621677"}
:::table_row{nodeId="9f0f6b0e-9634-4d5c-9c67-79562a63211b"}
:::table_header{colwidth="100" bgColor="#FFF" nodeId="0d123a95-9bbb-4bfe-91ea-0c1e8a5d8a48"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="5da4c09d-2059-4124-b3fe-cc0ef7628eba"}
**接口**
:::
:::
:::table_header{colwidth="430" bgColor="#FFF" nodeId="a13fae2e-c7f7-43da-a19b-965891d19a7e"}
:::paragraph{nodeId="a3187549-fde2-441c-a102-bb580b856cda"}
**方法**
:::
:::
:::table_header{colwidth="220" bgColor="#FFF" nodeId="32b8f9d2-b8fc-4ddd-8195-989d36efbf6b"}
