:::heading{level=3 nodeId="4aab91d1-782c-4f82-97fb-410eb539a4a6"}
8.5 断点续传
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="926c897f-4aaf-4dd9-920c-d3729e6c8be2"}
页面加载 → 拉取用户全量签到状态 → 找到当前节气窗口 → 跳过已完成节气 → 恢复到正确状态节点。中途退出再进入，所有已签/已过期/已领奖状态保持不变。
:::

:::horizontal_rule{nodeId="7f884cf9-cef9-4a36-9fbc-b08829c49b6e"}:::

:::heading{level=2 nodeId="7b911321-662a-432b-8bb4-195acb8154e6"}
九、接口契约
:::

:::heading{level=3 nodeId="aa294f37-0e6d-40d8-8077-562890d5118b"}
9.1 玩法查询
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="3f4fae2f-f785-4f8d-826e-33d97d0fa941"}
GET /api/play/{playId}/status?userId={userId}
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="c658c7e2-e588-426a-a599-9ffe7a985cef"}
返回：taskList（每个节气格子状态）、totalSignedCount、rewardList（含领取状态）
:::

:::heading{level=3 nodeId="84a6738b-1870-48bf-b667-503c122c142b"}
9.2 签到
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="10d42f1a-d852-43ed-93b5-b12cfc9d7811"}
POST /api/play/{playId}/checkin
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="9a4f911b-ac28-45e4-aa96-e633f98bb25c"}
Request: { userId, taskIndex } → Response: { success, totalSignedCount, thresholdReached, unlockedRewardId }
:::

:::heading{level=3 nodeId="03d47d1f-b4ea-444d-afdc-1788a60e3e48"}
9.3 奖品领取
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="ec0ec5e1-fdea-4505-8cae-410c94efe4a2"}
POST /api/play/{playId}/reward/claim
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="5d5ebd5c-b065-44af-b8c7-e0dfdd915ddc"}
Request: { userId, rewardId } → Response: { success, claimToken, needLeadForm, formId }
:::

:::paragraph{nodeId="32e9857e-75a0-49d4-8e9e-6e27e527c690"}
